    "created_at": "2026-02-11T15:01:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-02-11T15:01:08Z",
    "body": "Do we want to use it internally though? Especially building on top of JS promises doesn't really work in \"in parallel\" and such. Fetch has some of this due to Streams and I don't think we ever really got to the bottom of it.",
