    "created_at": "2026-02-11T15:17:36Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-02-11T15:17:54Z",
    "body": "I would personally be very happy if we stop using JS promises internally altogether and only use it for IDL purpose, yeah.\n\nMaking it clear that this is JS promise would maybe let us think twice when using it... 🤔",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
